{
	"info": {
		"name": "KMS Module - Agrofusion Audit",
		"description": "Colección de endpoints para el módulo KMS (Key Management Service)\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANTE: Antes de usar esta colección, debes:\n1. Obtener un token JWT desde el módulo de autenticación (auth)\n2. Configurar la variable 'access_token' en esta colección con tu token\n3. El token debe tener el formato: Bearer <token>\n\nPara obtener el token, usa el endpoint de login del módulo auth.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"exec": [
					"// Validar que access_token esté configurado",
					"const accessToken = pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token');",
					"if (!accessToken || accessToken === '') {",
					"    console.warn('⚠️ ADVERTENCIA: access_token no está configurado. Configura la variable access_token con tu token JWT.');",
					"    console.warn('   Puedes obtener el token desde el endpoint de login del módulo auth.');",
					"}"
				],
				"type": "text/javascript"
			}
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Gestión de Claves",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Crear Clave Criptográfica",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Capturar key_id automáticamente de la respuesta",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.key_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('key_id', response.key_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ key_id guardado:', response.key_id);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"project_id\": \"{{project_id}}\",\n  \"key_alias\": \"test-key-2025\",\n  \"algorithm\": \"RSA-2048\",\n  \"key_purpose\": \"signing\",\n  \"valid_to\": \"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys"]
						},
						"description": "Crea una nueva clave criptográfica para un proyecto. El key_id se guarda automáticamente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Obtener Clave por ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene información pública de una clave criptográfica"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Listar Claves de Proyecto",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys?project_id={{project_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "project_id",
									"value": "{{project_id}}"
								},
								{
									"key": "status_filter",
									"value": "",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista todas las claves de un proyecto"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Obtener Claves Activas",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/project/{{project_id}}/active",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "project", "{{project_id}}", "active"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "key_purpose",
									"value": "",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene todas las claves activas y válidas de un proyecto"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Rotar Clave",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Validar que key_id exista",
									"const keyId = pm.collectionVariables.get('key_id');",
									"if (!keyId || keyId === '') {",
									"    throw new Error('ERROR: Primero debes crear una clave. Ejecuta \"1. Crear Clave Criptográfica\" primero.');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rotation_reason\": \"scheduled\",\n  \"grace_period_days\": 30\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}/rotate",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}", "rotate"]
						},
						"description": "Rota una clave criptográfica generando una nueva.\n\nNOTA: El key_id viene de la URL (variable {{key_id}}), NO se envía en el body.\n\nOpciones para rotation_reason:\n- scheduled: Rotación programada\n- compromised: Clave comprometida\n- manual: Rotación manual\n- policy: Por política de seguridad"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "6. Historial de Rotaciones",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}/rotations",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}", "rotations"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene el historial de rotaciones de una clave"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "7. Revocar Clave - RF-INT-20",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"manual\",\n  \"note\": \"Revocación solicitada por administrador\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}/revoke",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}", "revoke"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-20: Revoca una clave criptográfica. Si tiene un certificado activo asociado, también se revoca en la misma transacción. Motivos permitidos: compromised, manual, policy."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoints para gestión de claves criptográficas"
		},
		{
			"name": "Firmas Digitales",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Crear Firma Digital - JWS (document_type=json)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Validar que key_id exista",
									"const keyId = pm.collectionVariables.get('key_id');",
									"if (!keyId || keyId === '') {",
									"    throw new Error('ERROR: Primero debes crear una clave. Ejecuta \"1. Crear Clave Criptográfica\" primero.');",
									"}",
									"",
									"// Calcular hash SHA-256 del documento automáticamente",
									"const document = pm.collectionVariables.get('document_content') || 'Documento de prueba';",
									"const hash = CryptoJS.SHA256(document).toString();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('document_hash', hash);",
									"",
									"// RF-INT-16: document_id es obligatorio. Generamos uno si no existe.",
									"let docId = pm.collectionVariables.get('document_id');",
									"if (!docId || docId === '') {",
									"    docId = (typeof crypto !== 'undefined' && crypto.randomUUID)",
									"        ? crypto.randomUUID()",
									"        : 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g, function(c){var r=Math.random()*16|0;var v=c==='x'?r:(r&0x3)|0x8;return v.toString(16);});",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('document_id', docId);",
									"}",
									"",
									"console.log('✓ Hash calculado:', hash);",
									"console.log('✓ Usando key_id:', keyId);",
									"console.log('✓ document_id:', docId);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.signature_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('signature_id', response.signature_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ signature_id guardado:', response.signature_id);",
									"    }",
									"    if (response.digital_signature) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('digital_signature', response.digital_signature);",
									"        console.log('✓ digital_signature guardado (formato ' + response.signature_format + ')');",
									"    }",
									"    if (response.certificate_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('certificate_id', response.certificate_id);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"document_hash\": \"{{document_hash}}\",\n  \"key_id\": \"{{key_id}}\",\n  \"hash_algorithm\": \"SHA-256\",\n  \"include_timestamp\": true,\n  \"document_id\": \"{{document_id}}\",\n  \"document_type\": \"json\",\n  \"signing_reason\": \"Prueba RF-INT-16 - JWS\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-16: firma digital. El sistema selecciona automáticamente el formato según document_type. Con 'json' devuelve un token JWS (header.payload.signature). El hash se calcula automáticamente y document_id se genera si no existe."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "1b. Crear Firma Digital - PKCS#7 (document_type=pdf)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const keyId = pm.collectionVariables.get('key_id');",
									"if (!keyId || keyId === '') {",
									"    throw new Error('ERROR: Primero debes crear una clave. Ejecuta \"1. Crear Clave Criptográfica\" primero.');",
									"}",
									"",
									"const document = pm.collectionVariables.get('document_content') || 'Documento de prueba';",
									"const hash = CryptoJS.SHA256(document).toString();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('document_hash', hash);",
									"",
									"// document_id obligatorio (RF-INT-16).",
									"const docId = (typeof crypto !== 'undefined' && crypto.randomUUID)",
									"    ? crypto.randomUUID()",
									"    : 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g, function(c){var r=Math.random()*16|0;var v=c==='x'?r:(r&0x3)|0x8;return v.toString(16);});",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('document_id', docId);",
									"console.log('✓ document_id generado para PKCS#7:', docId);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const r = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (r.signature_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('signature_id', r.signature_id);",
									"    if (r.digital_signature) pm.collectionVariables.set('digital_signature', r.digital_signature);",
									"    console.log('✓ Formato recibido:', r.signature_format);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"document_hash\": \"{{document_hash}}\",\n  \"key_id\": \"{{key_id}}\",\n  \"hash_algorithm\": \"SHA-256\",\n  \"include_timestamp\": true,\n  \"document_id\": \"{{document_id}}\",\n  \"document_type\": \"pdf\",\n  \"signing_reason\": \"Prueba RF-INT-16 - PKCS#7\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-16: con document_type='pdf' (u otro binario: xml, csv, zip...), el sistema genera un objeto PKCS#7/CMS DER en Base64 que contiene la firma y el certificado del firmante."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Validar Firma Digital - Mínimo (RF-INT-17)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Validación ejecutada', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"var j = pm.response.json();",
									"console.log('validation_result =', j.validation_result);",
									"console.log('validation_reason =', j.validation_reason);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"signature_id\": \"{{signature_id}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-17: valida la firma aportando SOLO el signature_id. El sistema reconstruye clave, certificado, formato (JWS o PKCS#7) y valida el certificado en modo histórico con reference_date = signed_at. Resultado posible: valid, invalid, expired, revoked."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2b. Validar Firma con Documento Modificado (RF-INT-17)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Se detecta manipulación', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(['INVALID']).to.include(j.validation_result);",
									"});"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"signature_id\": \"{{signature_id}}\",\n  \"document_content\": \"Este documento fue ALTERADO despues de firmar.\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-17 - detección de manipulación: el sistema recalcula el hash del document_content enviado y lo compara con el almacenado. Si no coincide, retorna INVALID con validation_reason = 'Document hash mismatch (document tampered)'."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2d. Validar Firma - Presentable al Usuario (RF-INT-18)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Respuesta presentable', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('estado');",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('resultado_general');",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('fecha_firma');",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('datos_tecnicos');",
									"    console.log('Estado:', j.estado);",
									"    console.log('Firmante:', j.firmante);",
									"    console.log('Resultado general:', j.resultado_general);",
									"});"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/{{signature_id}}/validate-presentable",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "{{signature_id}}", "validate-presentable"]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-18: valida la firma únicamente con el signature_id en la URL y devuelve el resultado en lenguaje comprensible (Válida / Inválida / Expirada / Revocada), el nombre del firmante resuelto desde el módulo de usuarios, la fecha de firma, el identificador del documento y los datos técnicos (hash, algoritmo, certificado) como información de solo lectura. El usuario no ingresa datos técnicos."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2c. Validar Firma Externa (document_hash + digital_signature)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"document_hash\": \"{{document_hash}}\",\n  \"digital_signature\": \"{{digital_signature}}\",\n  \"key_id\": \"{{key_id}}\",\n  \"hash_algorithm\": \"SHA-256\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "Validación de una firma EXTERNA/EXPORTADA: el cliente aporta el hash, la firma (JWS o CMS Base64) y el key_id asociado. Útil para verificar firmas importadas."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Obtener Firma por ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/{{signature_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "{{signature_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene información detallada de una firma digital"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Listar Firmas de Proyecto",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures?project_id={{project_id}}&limit=10&offset=0",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "project_id",
									"value": "{{project_id}}"
								},
								{
									"key": "limit",
									"value": "10"
								},
								{
									"key": "offset",
									"value": "0"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista las firmas digitales de un proyecto con paginación"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Obtener Firmas de Documento",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/document/{{document_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "document", "{{document_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene todas las firmas asociadas a un documento específico"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "6. Consultar Firmas - RF-INT-19 (paginación 5 + filtros)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Listado paginado', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('items');",
									"    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('total_count');",
									"    pm.expect(j.limit).to.eql(5);",
									"});"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/query?offset=0",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "query"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "offset", "value": "0"},
								{"key": "date_from", "value": "", "disabled": true},
								{"key": "date_to", "value": "", "disabled": true},
								{"key": "signer_user_id", "value": "", "disabled": true},
								{"key": "document_type", "value": "", "disabled": true},
								{"key": "validation_status", "value": "valid", "disabled": true}
							]
						},
						"description": "RF-INT-19: listado paginado (5 por página) de firmas digitales con filtros opcionales por rango de fechas (date_from/date_to), usuario firmante, tipo de documento y estado de validación. No expone digital_signature ni contenido del certificado."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "7. Detalle de Firma - RF-INT-19 (sin datos sensibles)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
